<title>JAPAN: Japan Aug housing starts up 14.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Aug housing starts up 14.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's housing starts in August rose 14.3 percent from a year earlier to 135,748 units, the Construction Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>					Aug starts   yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Private homes			55,177	    +26.1</p>
<p> Rental homes			 50,126	     +4.5</p>
<p> Employee housing		    1,960	     +3.9</p>
<p> Housing built for sale	   28,485	    +13.3</p>
<p>  (Condominiums)		    15,443	    +25.1</p>
<p> Total				 135,748	    +14.3</p>
</text>
